<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Meredith buy reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Meredith buy reiterated.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Gruntal &amp; Co Inc said Tuesday it reiterated a buy recommendation on Meredith Corp.</p>
<p>--Analyst Rita Zanella Benson, in a report, said she modified her EPS estimates and price target to reflect the company's previously announced two-for-one stock split. Her estimates were changed to $1.19 from $2.38 for 1997 and to $1.23 from $2.46 for 1998.</p>
<p>--Her price target on the media company's stock is $30, representing a potential upside of 22 percent.</p>
<p>--Meredith was up 3/8 at 24-7/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
